Every Node reads and updates the same State.

====

Comparison Table

| Concept           | Description                                              | Example                                                            |
| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Node**          | A single task or operation in the workflow               | Search buses, process payment, send confirmation                   |
| **State**         | Shared data that carries information across the workflow | Customer name, travel date, seat number, payment status            |
| **Orchestration** | The logic that coordinates and controls the workflow     | Decides the order of execution, branching, retries, and completion |

=========

One-Line Summary
Node → Does the work.
State → Stores the information.
Orchestration → Controls the workflow.
